          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A clear faulty-scale problem leads to Nella’s honest disclosure and a practical pear-and-apple solution; the repaired needle provides a concrete close.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Nella discovers the small error, tells Mrs. Vale before delivery, and corrects the basket; the final checked dial neatly shows growth.\" ,\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The scale’s larger error is clearly tested and honestly fixed with more apples, ending on Nella carefully checking the dial for the next customer.\" ,\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Giving Sam an apple contributes to the shortage, and Nella’s prompt honesty leads to a believable fruit-blend compromise and repaired scale.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A straightforward discovery-and-correction plot: Nella reports the faulty reading, adds apples, and earns continued trust through careful action.\" ,\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Nella knowingly sends a light basket, so Mrs. Vale’s return creates a meaningful consequence; the quiet loss of trust gives the repair emotional weight.\" ,\"group_id\":2},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Nella hides the error until Mrs. Vale returns, then admits it and helps make a pear blend; the apology and true scale form a complete moral resolution.\" ,\"group_id\":3},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The deliberate lie, customer’s discovery, correction, and subdued trust loss make a coherent consequence-driven story with a concrete final image.\" ,\"group_id\":2},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A shortage and faulty scale tempt Nella to conceal the problem; after being caught, she admits it and completes the order with pears.\" ,\"group_id\":3},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Nella identifies both the shortage and the scale error before Mrs. Vale leaves, then they choose pears together; the ending reinforces honest repair.\" ,\"group_id\":0}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":2,\"causal_path\":4,\"ending\":3,\"language\":2,\"overall\":3},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All ten stories share Nella, Mrs. Vale, the clinic-tart apple order, and a faulty dial scale. They branch mainly between prompt honesty and correction (s000029, s000057, s000047, s000073, s000034, s000085) and concealment followed by a customer return (s000043, s000068, s000096, s000005). The shortage/pear substitution and degree of trust loss create some material variants, but the prose and recurring repaired-scale ending are highly templated. This sample does not establish diversity for the entire generator.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"Nella notices the faulty scale and an apple shortage before delivery, tells Mrs. Vale, and they complete the order with apples and pears.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"Nella notices the faulty scale before delivery, tells Mrs. Vale, and corrects the order by adding enough apples.\"},{\"group_id\":2,\"summary\":\"Nella knowingly delivers a light apple order; Mrs. Vale returns, Nella adds apples, and trust is damaged.\"},{\"group_id\":3,\"summary\":\"Nella knowingly delivers a light order; after Mrs. Vale returns, insufficient apples require a pear-and-apple blend and an apology.\"}]}"
        }
